<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{{ title }} · resonating loop</title>

  {#- VISIBILITY: unlisted pages must not be indexed by search engines.
      Explicit equality (== 'unlisted') so intent reads right off the page.
      public → indexable; private → never built, so never reaches here. -#}
  {% if visibility == 'unlisted' %}
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
  {% endif %}

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <main class="prose">
    {{ content | safe }}
  </main>
</body>
</html>
